    <string name="hint_m4a">Recommended. AAC, on YouTube saved without re-encoding (about 60 MB per hour).</string>
    <string name="hint_mp3">For car stereos that play USB sticks. Re-encoded on the phone, so it takes a little longer.</string>
    <string name="hint_original">Best sound as the site streams it (on YouTube mostly Opus), no conversion.</string>
    <string name="hint_saver">About 64 kbit/s: plenty for talks and podcasts, about 30 MB per hour.</string>
